    "description": {
      "value": "These bones from different types of demons can be used to form temporary barriers. When you crush the bone fragments and blow the resulting dust around yourself as you cast shield, the shield appears as a bone bulwark shaped like the demon's face.\n\nWhen use Shield Block with the spell, the barrier explodes into many bone fragments. The shards cause persistent bleed damage to each creature adjacent to you that fails a Reflex save at the listed DC. This persistent bleed damage is unholy and can be stopped with an Interact action to remove the shards.\n\nThe persistent bleed damage is 2d8, and the save DC is 34."
    },
